kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/3873beffbe177c3509fa4ca692352ccdc6cd8d57/ss_3873beffbe177c3509fa4ca692352ccdc6cd8d57.600x338.jpg?t=1759424666"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/ss_b8c5e2bdbfa47df1b26fcf06e11391158ea475ca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759424666","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/ss_b8c5e2bdbfa47df1b26fcf06e11391158ea475ca.600x338.jpg?t=1759424666"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/1cbdbcf11a03bd960d078cf2e6213b43c171fab1/ss_1cbdbcf11a03bd960d078cf2e6213b43c171fab1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759424666","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/1cbdbcf11a03bd960d078cf2e6213b43c171fab1/ss_1cbdbcf11a03bd960d078cf2e6213b43c171fab1.600x338.jpg?t=1759424666"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/ss_24164f465e87f7cb20eba94e8a3e97351668ca1c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759424666","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/ss_24164f465e87f7cb20eba94e8a3e97351668ca1c.600x338.jpg?t=1759424666"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/ece8e0289a803052a78b012f72f0343fe2b82e35/ss_ece8e0289a803052a78b012f72f0343fe2b82e35.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759424666","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/ece8e0289a803052a78b012f72f0343fe2b82e35/ss_ece8e0289a803052a78b012f72f0343fe2b82e35.600x338.jpg?t=1759424666"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/3210eeeacd53eccb7e8e9ec4e1ccfd46eabf4285/ss_3210eeeacd53eccb7e8e9ec4e1ccfd46eabf4285.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759424666","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/3210eeeacd53eccb7e8e9ec4e1ccfd46eabf4285/ss_3210eeeacd53eccb7e8e9ec4e1ccfd46eabf4285.600x338.jpg?t=1759424666"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/7203a79d8ee1d0e7cb49b2808fab47d5a5427329/ss_7203a79d8ee1d0e7cb49b2808fab47d5a5427329.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759424666","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/7203a79d8ee1d0e7cb49b2808fab47d5a5427329/ss_7203a79d8ee1d0e7cb49b2808fab47d5a5427329.600x338.jpg?t=1759424666"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/3218cbb9c3d62d58f2ab52e3b1f72b9c54438580/ss_3218cbb9c3d62d58f2ab52e3b1f72b9c54438580.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759424666","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/3218cbb9c3d62d58f2ab52e3b1f72b9c54438580/ss_3218cbb9c3d62d58f2ab52e3b1f72b9c54438580.600x338.jpg?t=1759424666"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/9648f95189e1704fd3c99f310c0bf1522667d364/ss_9648f95189e1704fd3c99f310c0bf1522667d364.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759424666","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/9648f95189e1704fd3c99f310c0bf1522667d364/ss_9648f95189e1704fd3c99f310c0bf1522667d364.600x338.jpg?t=1759424666"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/aee028fa0f553af0bf0607ed274c1ca9807824d4/ss_aee028fa0f553af0bf0607ed274c1ca9807824d4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759424666","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/aee028fa0f553af0bf0607ed274c1ca9807824d4/ss_aee028fa0f553af0bf0607ed274c1ca9807824d4.600x338.jpg?t=1759424666"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/1e92f15408f67b6dc670b64be8c0fec1c1ab3a77/ss_1e92f15408f67b6dc670b64be8c0fec1c1ab3a77.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759424666","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945150/1e92f15408f67b6dc670b64be8c0fec1c1ab3a77/ss_1e92f15408f67b6dc670b64be8c0fec1c1ab3a77.600x338.jpg?t=1759424666"}],"short_description":"There's only one detective to unravel this murder turned museum heist... and they're the cat's meow. Interrogate a &quot;colorful&quot; cast of suspects until they cough up hairballs... and the truth. Will you wrap up the case in time for an afternoon nap, and make injustice knead its last biscuit?","steam_appid":2945150,"support_info":{"email":"eric@nobodycrown.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://nobodycrown.com/#ffmm"}